<http://data.silknow.org/object/9daadcb3-d77a-31ad-a24a-84d1dc3d3411>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Hanging panel of coarse linen embroidered with floss silks in long and short, satin and stem stitches with Pekin knots and laid and couched work; some padding. Lined with green silk damask with a small spring motif.\nThe embroidered decoration depicts a pair of peacocks and peonies. The image is surrounded with a 5.25 inch border of brown silk with a brocaded floral pattern on all sides."@en , "Hanging picture panel of linen embroidered with silk threads, Japan, 19th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/6040a163-ad32-3953-a19a-9abc02f9524e> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/1b5aba54-05f2-3e63-a0cf-da55faf46f41> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/6fb61b9b-3cb1-36ca-a543-6bbae6e3e0d4> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/89266eba-a7ff-3c98-8330-cb56646d42b0> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/ab667c92-f90c-3b56-b476-508cddde4ff4> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Hanging panel of coarse linen embroidered with floss silks in long and short, satin and stem stitches with Pekin knots and laid and couched work; some padding. Lined with green silk damask with a small spring motif.\nThe embroidered decoration depicts a pair of peacocks and peonies. The image is surrounded with a 5.25 inch border of brown silk with a brocaded floral pattern on all sides."@en , "Hanging picture panel of linen embroidered with silk threads, Japan, 19th century"@en ;
